        "sid": "DEU 23"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "23",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Möminye chi nyo kikelat anta nyo kakemutïta pïrïtenyi kïtas kegh nko pipö ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Möminye chi nyo le kighosan nyo tuyot nko pipö ECHOTYON anta chini le monechi ntökwit pïnwöy taman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Möminye chi pö pipö Amon anta nyo pö pipö Moap nyo tuyot nko pipö ECHOTYON anta chini le monechi ntökwit pïnwöy taman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.22.1+NUM.22.2+NUM.22.3+NUM.22.4+NUM.22.5+NUM.22.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kiy 22:1-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kitagh chane kïkonokwa omisyö nko pögh atakinye kyopkonokwa Misri, akwal Palaam wero Peor nyo ngwïno Petor nyo mi Mesopotamia kïchïpokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kiy 23:7–24:9.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo melö kïchömchï ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa Palaam lenyoni, wölo kïwaghach chïpötonay kïlïkwï kisoyönöt, ompöwölo kichamakwa nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona, motöp lö kingöroköy puntonichoni kïsïch kalya anta sïkönöt kokay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Motöp lö osösöy pipö Edom, ompöwölo werkökwa chane amasas pipö Misri, ompöwölo kyochikwa ton ompö korengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muköy monekwa cho pö pïnta nyo pö sömök kïtuyö nko pipö ECHOTYON.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kitïlilöto wölo möngöy pipö lïk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akwotini omitekwa möngot ato le osiswo poryot, olowitö kegh kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo ighokwa orusitunö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato mi chi anka tïkwïl ompö akwa nyo kerwotïtö akwam menyon akany kïweghö möngot kutang sany akïtöpö wöloni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo otini karich kwimön akany kïmwat kegh apïsyï kïlït möngot otini köröytö asis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akï mïchini kïmi wölo wetöy chi kïsiröy ompö möngot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mïchini kïtïng chi köpompö ompö korichi nyo ato mököy kusiröy, kïpal ngwïny akwotini kewonyö kïtïp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agha möngengwo kïtïlilit, ompöwölo mi nko akwa ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa möngot, atökïkonokwa owesyö nyo irïntegho punkökwo. Irip kegh nyu tömegha kïgh nyo le sïmnyon, atö megh nyinte kïwaghaka akïpïstokwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kirurutkö walaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mayoda sekeyon ato perunö wölo mi echotyontenyi akungwïn wölo omitekwa lö tagheta nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Opïsyinökwa kïmang kanasyan anka tïkwïl nyo kakïl nyinte. Amakany kerey nyinte.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.19.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 19:29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kïkïro tipö Israel nko werkö cheporesnan ompö Kö pö Tororöt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amopï Kö pö ECHOTYON Tororötïngwo ropïyen cho kakïnyorï ompö or nyo lata nyoni ataghakteghena kiwalwalatengwo, ompöwölo ghöchini ECHOTYON Tororötïnkwa ngalechoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Wuw 22:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.36+LEV.25.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 25:36-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.7+DEU.15.8+DEU.15.9+DEU.15.10+DEU.15.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Krt 15:7-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Akwoto ipösönchï werïngwo chi pö srael ropïyen anta omisyö anta kïgh anka tïkwïl, maghak tösöw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukekwa oghoke chi nyo le ton tösöw ompö kïgh nyo kopösönchikwa, wölo mopösönchï werïngwo chi pö Israel aghach tösöw, atenyorunenö kisoyönöt ECHOTYON Tororötïngu ompö kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo ighekwa ompö korononi opetekwa ochengöy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
